{% comment %}
  B2B storefront helpers.

  This snippet used to carry the variant hiding: CSS that masked every variant
  picker until JavaScript had fetched this buyer's catalog rules and hidden the
  pack sizes they may not order. That is gone, because Shopify does it properly
  now. ProductVariant supports variant-level publishing, so a pack size can be
  excluded from a catalog and Shopify enforces it server-side -- the variant is
  not in the page at all, and a product with every variant excluded returns a
  404 rather than an unbuyable card.

  Removing it fixes a real customer-facing fault rather than just tidying up.
  The old path called the app for every product card on every page view, and any
  slow or failed answer left the card reading "Back Soon" on stocked product,
  stuck that way until the shopper reloaded.

  The rules still exist in the Catalog Manager as the policy. What enforces them
  is api.catalog-variant-sync, which keeps Shopify's variant exclusions matching
  the rules, including for products published later.

  What is left here:
    - the "Special Deals" menu gate, since deal eligibility is not something
      Shopify can express
    - a struck-through retail price for variants that have no compare-at price
      set, which the theme cannot show on its own

  Variables expected from the block (via render tag):
    app_url  — base URL of the deployed Catalog Manager app
{% endcomment %}
{% if customer and customer.b2b? %}
  {%- comment -%}
    Get the active B2B location from the session.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign cvh_location_id = customer.current_location.id -%}
  {%- if cvh_location_id == blank -%}
    {%- assign cvh_location_id = cart.company_location.id -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    ── "Special Deals" menu gate ──────────────────────────────────────────────
    BOGO deals are scoped per catalog in the Catalog Manager BOGO page, and at
    the moment all five are limited to the General Catalog. A buyer on any other
    catalog who follows this menu item sees offers they cannot get, so the link
    is hidden for them.

    Hidden by default and only ever revealed, deliberately. The eligibility
    answer arrives from the app, so the alternative -- show it, then remove it
    -- would flash offers at buyers who are not entitled to them, and would
    leave the link in place whenever the app is unreachable. This way an
    ineligible buyer never sees it at all, and the worst case for a General
    buyer is the item appearing a moment late (instantly on repeat visits,
    which are cached in localStorage).

    Deals are scoped by catalog, not hard-coded here: if a deal is later opened
    up to another catalog in the admin, that catalog's buyers start seeing this
    link on their own with no theme change.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <style id="cvh-deals-mask">
    /*
     * Matches the menu item in any menu it appears in (header, mobile drawer,
     * footer) by its page URL rather than its label, so renaming the menu item
     * does not silently un-hide it. The <li> is hidden as well as the link so
     * the nav does not keep an empty gap where it was.
     */
    html:not(.cvh-deals-ok) a[href$="/pages/special-deals"],
    html:not(.cvh-deals-ok) li:has(> a[href$="/pages/special-deals"]),
    html:not(.cvh-deals-ok) li:has(> details > summary > a[href$="/pages/special-deals"]) {
      display: none !important;
    }
  </style>

  {%- comment -%}
    The retail price to strike through, for variants with no compare-at price.
    Two different units are in play and mixing them was a real bug: the
    custom.standard_retail_price metafield is a plain decimal (24.30), while
    compare_at_price and price are in cents and need money_without_currency.
    Piping the metafield through that filter read 24.30 as cents and emitted
    0.24, which is below every real price, so no strikethrough was ever drawn.
    Kept separate here.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign cvh_retail = '' -%}
  {%- if product -%}
    {%- assign cvh_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
    {%- assign cvh_retail_meta = cvh_variant.metafields.custom.standard_retail_price -%}
    {%- if cvh_retail_meta != blank -%}
      {%- assign cvh_retail = cvh_retail_meta -%}
    {%- elsif cvh_variant.compare_at_price != blank -%}
      {%- assign cvh_retail = cvh_variant.compare_at_price | money_without_currency -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}

<div
  id="catalog-variant-hider-data"
  data-app-url="{{ app_url | default: 'https://dutch-rusk-catalog-manager.onrender.com' | strip_newlines }}"
  data-location-id="{{ cvh_location_id | url_encode }}"
  data-customer-id="{{ customer.id }}"
  data-shop="{{ shop.permanent_domain }}"
  {% if product %}
    data-product-id="gid://shopify/Product/{{ product.id }}"
    data-standard-retail-price="{{ cvh_retail }}"
  {% endif %}
  style="display:none;"
  aria-hidden="true"
></div>
<script src="{{ 'catalog-variant-hider.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
{% endif %}
